# Performance profiling captures (npm run perf:web) — local artifacts.
/perf-profiles/*
# ADR-0138: a curated per-campaign subset of raw captures is tracked, so a metric
# correction can be re-scored against history instead of recaptured on hardware.
!/perf-profiles/evidence/
/.perf-state/

# Lighthouse audit reports (.claude/skills/lighthouse-audit) — attach to the PR, don't commit.
/lighthouse-reports/

# Vectorizer.AI traces (.claude/skills/vectorize-image) — promote a keeper deliberately.
/vectorized/

